The `QQL-EDGE-UNSUPPORTED-` prefix is the family marker used by the edge
backend to classify capability rejections; individual codes always carry the
full suffix. New codes may be introduced in a v1 minor release (see
`language/v1/spec/versioning.md`), so treat this list as a snapshot of the
current reference implementation.
